---
title: Vodka Martini
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, vodka]
source: Classic cocktail, number 28 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #mixing cup{}(with ice), pour @vodka{2.5%fl_oz} and @dry vermouth{0.5%fl_oz}. Stir well, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with @green olives{1} or a @lemon peel{1%twist}.
